From 75cc83423b0f9f4200db74171f8c16351fad5d8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:11:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Walk literal variable execution candidates across
 function bodies

Retain additive literal assignment candidates across sourced scripts, pairing only command, eval and shell operands. Strip redirect targets and leave dynamic assignment evaluation to the existing walk. Bound every emitted payload with the existing recursion budget. Real Bash differential tests replace Hermes with a harmless marker function; baseline misses 10 of the original 18 execution cases.
